  "releaseNotes": "Show QR codes on the desktop: the engine registers `IQrCodeService`, `QrCodeImage` turns a text into a frozen `BitmapSource`, and the themed `QrCodeView` control draws a scannable code from XAML in light and dark themes. New theme brushes for tonal secondary surfaces are also available.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.20/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Wpf.Core/0.1.0-alpha.20.md",
